Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.09,0:08:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效对方的攻击无效战斗带来的破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.35,0:08:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 还有强力的守备力。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.80,0:08:37.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}简直就是 铁壁般的防守。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加油 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.25,0:08:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 干得不错。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:44.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说过的吧。 胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.27,0:08:46.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不到最后一刻是不知道的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.91,0:08:49.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 你的生命值 已经只剩100了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.81,0:08:50.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你打算怎么办。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.75,0:08:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人类这种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.88,0:08:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凭着廉价的同伴意识{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.04,0:08:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一边依赖着所谓的信任之心{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.16,0:09:01.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了自己的利益却能毫不在乎地背叛同伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.93,0:09:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可偏偏又没法彻底舍弃所谓的同伴羁绊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.10,0:09:10.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体 你已经被九十九游马
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.16,0:09:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被人类的软弱所浸染了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.61,0:09:17.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样的你 怎么可能完成原本的使命。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.76,0:09:18.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.68,0:09:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你觉得你为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.33,0:09:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法吸收 CNo.？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.10,0:09:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.74,0:09:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为没有我的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.16,0:09:34.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有我的话 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.09,0:09:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是不可能全部集齐的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.97,0:09:41.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你没有资格得到源数代码。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.77,0:09:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此　那就在这里你赢下来就好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.26,0:09:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别管我　动手吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.06,0:09:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还　不到那个时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.28,0:09:56.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我　就这样回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.01,0:09:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合…　抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.55,0:10:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和　异晶人联手了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.64,0:10:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那意味着什么就让你见识一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.91,0:10:07.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我　发动升阶魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.92,0:10:09.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.81,0:10:11.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶之力…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.44,0:10:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以让自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.47,0:10:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽超量升阶{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.92,0:10:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进化为混沌超量。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.78,0:10:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用阶级２的审判破坏者叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.98,0:10:25.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以１只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.51,0:10:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.87,0:10:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变换。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.62,0:10:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！CNo.65。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.11,0:10:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}缠绕着无数怨念的裁决魔王……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.93,0:10:47.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}裁断魔王……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.29,0:10:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}审判恶魔！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.05,0:10:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是那家伙的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.48,0:10:54.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.19,0:10:57.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}审判恶魔的效果 发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.69,0:10:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要这只怪兽在场上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.15,0:11:02.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方怪兽的效果无效化
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.50,0:11:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且不能发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.48,0:11:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 无效攻击和破坏的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.84,0:11:10.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果就无法发动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.90,0:11:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（真月）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.43,0:11:13.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁壁般的守备这下也白搭了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.73,0:11:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真遗憾啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.70,0:11:19.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 护封剑的剑士的守备力是2400。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.59,0:11:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗破坏是不可能的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.86,0:11:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不好说？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.59,0:11:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动审判恶魔的进一步效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.89,0:11:30.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个混沌超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.39,0:11:33.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让对方一只怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.76,0:11:34.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}或者守备力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.86,0:11:37.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降1000点。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.75,0:11:44.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 黑雾把护封剑的剑士粉碎掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.94,0:11:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还远远没完呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.84,0:11:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用审判恶魔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.51,0:11:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对星光体直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.42,0:11:57.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了…要是吃了这一击…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.35,0:11:59.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体就输了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.22,0:12:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱。 超量重生。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.43,0:12:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让自己墓地里的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.54,0:12:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽超量复活。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.06,0:12:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.20,0:12:11.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.39 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.99,0:12:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 超量重生还会{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.14,0:12:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让复活的怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.66,0:12:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为叠放单位！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧……垂死挣扎。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.58,0:12:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}审判恶魔。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.75,0:12:24.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击中止。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.27,0:12:28.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但只要审判恶魔还在
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.23,0:12:30.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果就无法使用。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.27,0:12:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 也无法攻击我。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.46,0:12:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管怎样 你都完蛋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.08,0:12:36.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.49,0:12:40.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都是我的错……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.62,0:12:42.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体是为了保护我……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.25,0:12:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要你 能进行原本的决斗的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.51,0:12:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果 决斗输了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.90,0:12:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体消失了的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.17,0:12:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…… 我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.37,0:12:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抬起头来。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.54,0:12:59.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要从眼前发生的事中移开视线。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.21,0:13:02.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}面对一切
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.97,0:13:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 想想自己能做什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:08.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 我我到底能做什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.46,0:13:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}告诉我啊 阿斯特拉…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.60,0:13:12.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别天真了！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.54,0:13:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《星光体…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.45,0:13:21.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我能做的事…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.98,0:13:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我现在该做的事…》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.01,0:13:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马 快察觉到吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.14,0:13:33.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你的话一定…》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.43,0:13:37.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《对了… 没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.40,0:13:40.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从这里逃出去。 无论如何。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.60,0:13:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只能这么干了！》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.69,0:13:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.55,0:13:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《如果能跳到对面的柱子上…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.76,0:13:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 要怎么做…》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:13:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对… 对了！！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.22,0:14:03.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵 和游马的告别已经打完了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.43,0:14:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗还没有结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.06,0:14:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 你的生命值 只剩100了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.51,0:14:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你到底还能做什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.79,0:14:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.06,0:14:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 盖一张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.73,0:14:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《但是 如果失败了我… 啊！》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.02,0:14:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是… 老爸的硬币。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.62,0:14:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 星光体他
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.34,0:14:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也在拼尽全力战斗着！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.93,0:14:41.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.76,0:14:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.09,0:14:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.15,0:15:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧… 别以为你能逃得掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.51,0:15:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～ 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.45,0:15:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把那家伙狠狠地 揍趴下！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.44,0:15:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.97,0:15:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我的绝对优势不会改变！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.29,0:15:25.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不一定。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.70,0:15:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜利的方程式早已成型了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.62,0:15:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.45,0:15:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将希望皇霍普作为超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.91,0:15:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.77,0:15:46.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.39！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.37,0:15:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将混沌化为光明的使者
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.74,0:15:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.14,0:15:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ 优越叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.17,0:16:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.88,0:16:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上的1只怪兽超量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.29,0:16:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其叠放单元的数量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.49,0:16:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比对方怪兽超量的叠放单元
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.10,0:16:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}合计更多时才能发动{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.12,0:16:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方的所有怪兽 全部破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.17,0:16:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体这边的叠放单元是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.37,0:16:16.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普雷的2个。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.12,0:16:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}96那边 只有黑雾的1个。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.85,0:16:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不… 不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.07,0:16:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的怪兽竟然被破坏了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.90,0:16:26.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 这个效果
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.26,0:16:28.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以通过使用叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.94,0:16:31.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让那只怪兽的破坏变得无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.36,0:16:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么办？No.96！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.38,0:16:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个黑雾的叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.23,0:16:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回避破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.74,0:16:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好耶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.52,0:16:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要叠放单位没了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.88,0:16:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙就 用不了效果了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.08,0:16:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到 第二回合就拿出逆转的卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.30,0:16:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！ 你这家伙 难道这一切状况
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.79,0:17:01.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都早已预料到了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.11,0:17:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.77,0:17:05.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.83,0:17:08.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是 被拿游马当人质的我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.36,0:17:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法攻击的这个计策
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.05,0:17:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给冲昏头了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.23,0:17:14.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟敢耍我！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.51,0:17:18.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要发动霍普雷的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.44,0:17:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.51,0:17:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普雷的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.92,0:17:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就提升500点！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放充能！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.11,0:17:32.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，每有1个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.68,0:17:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.35,0:17:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就下降1000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.54,0:17:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的败北已经注定了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.32,0:17:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……我！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.38,0:17:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧～霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.77,0:17:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普雷！攻击黑雾！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.95,0:17:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不会让你如愿！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.04,0:17:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.31,0:17:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌回归！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.15,0:18:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在对方攻击时将那次攻击无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.01,0:18:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.07,0:18:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，丢弃1张手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.12,0:18:08.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动墓地的魔法卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.91,0:18:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动墓地的升阶魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.19,0:18:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.95,0:18:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用阶级2的黑雾进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.21,0:18:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.93,0:18:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.35,0:18:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.78,0:18:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.96！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.76,0:18:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}掀起混沌之风暴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.96,0:18:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此刻 降临于此吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.22,0:18:58.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑风暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.32,0:19:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑雾混沌化了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.73,0:19:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 你这家伙就无法吸收我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.50,0:19:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙… 自己主动混沌化了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.77,0:19:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动混沌回归的更进一步效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.33,0:19:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.31,0:19:31.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效了攻击的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.76,0:19:34.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须重新发动攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.78,0:19:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.56,0:19:37.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}强制让它攻击吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.54,0:19:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 要重新发动一度停止的攻击？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.65,0:19:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑风暴的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.87,0:19:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙 在战斗中被破坏时
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.96,0:19:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}产生的 战斗伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.91,0:19:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双方玩家都要承受！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.27,0:19:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.65,0:20:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊… 同归于尽…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.21,0:20:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.96…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.90,0:20:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.73,0:20:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧！ 事已至此 就让你们所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.00,0:20:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都成为这座城的陪葬吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.63,0:20:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.92,0:20:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体… 胜负就先寄存在你那里。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.65,0:20:49.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.96…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.37,0:20:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.58,0:20:56.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.57,0:20:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 你会！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解释 之后再说！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.28,0:21:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）遗迹里的 7张 No.卡…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.79,0:21:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.72,0:21:18.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 这次被异晶人那帮家伙给抢走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.72,0:21:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《星光体…》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.85,0:21:27.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（贝库塔）好险。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.25,0:21:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 No.没事 比什么都好…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.00,0:21:31.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真不爽啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.68,0:21:34.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然我配合了你那无聊的计策
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.66,0:21:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底 你这家伙作为恶人只是二流…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.60,0:21:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（贝库塔）你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.53,0:21:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.76,0:21:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等下次有事的时候我再来找你 我的仆人！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.09,0:21:46.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！ 站住！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.53,0:21:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（千尊）别管他。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.09,0:21:49.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}千尊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.03,0:21:52.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（千尊）一切都在计划之中…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.75,0:21:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比起那个 你还有该做的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.27,0:21:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（贝库塔）什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.72,0:22:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（多恩·萨乌赞）差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.02,0:22:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些家伙快醒了吧…。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.85,0:23:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.18,0:23:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.86,0:23:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.06,0:23:53.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.97,0:23:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.77,0:23:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.59,0:23:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.20,0:24:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
